You fire a disabling shot at a target's throat (or equivalent), dealing [66%, 77%, 86%, 93%, 100% (TL1-5)] weapon damage and silencing them for [2, 3, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

If the target is marked, you consume the mark to fire two secondary shots at their arms and legs (or other appendages) dealing [16%, 19%, 21%, 23%, 25% (TL1-5)] damage, reducing their movement speed by 50% and disarming them for the duration.

The status chance increases with your Accuracy.
